# Copy to .env. Every value is optional: the desk runs with
# market data and news out of the box. Only investigations
# need a language model.

# --- Language model (OpenAI-compatible endpoint) -----------
# Exactly ONE of the two blocks below may be active. The loader
# keeps the FIRST value it sees for a key, so leaving both
# uncommented silently uses the upper one.

# A) The same model hosted by NVIDIA: no GPU needed.
#    Key: https://build.nvidia.com -> the model page -> "Get API Key".
# LLM_PROVIDER=nvidia-nim
# LLM_BASE_URL=https://integrate.api.nvidia.com/v1
# LLM_MODEL=nvidia/nemotron-3.5-lightning-30b-a3b
# LLM_API_KEY=nvapi-...

# B) Local vLLM on the GPU box, started with `make llm`
#    (or tunnelled: ssh -L 8000:localhost:8000 user@gpu-box).
LLM_PROVIDER=vllm-local
LLM_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1
LLM_MODEL=nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Lightning-30B-A3B-BF16

# How reasoning is switched off per request:
#   chat_template  Nemotron 3 / 3.5 (enable_thinking kwarg)
#   system_prompt  Llama-Nemotron   (/no_think)
# If the server refuses the field, the client drops it and
# strips any <think> block from the answer instead.
LLM_THINKING_CONTROL=chat_template

# Concurrent model requests. Keep it low on a hosted free
# tier (rate limits); 8 or more is fine on your own GPUs.
LLM_WORKERS=8

# --- Replay -------------------------------------------------
# Pin the desk to a past date: later prices and later news do
# not exist. Use it for a recorded, reproducible demo. Run
# `make news` after changing it. Unset means live.
# AS_OF=2026-09-18

# --- News ---------------------------------------------------
# Historical news is read from data/archive/news, filled by
# `make news`. Finnhub (free key at finnhub.io) is the better
# provider for equities; GDELT needs no key but is throttled.
# Yahoo Finance (no key) is merged in for the most recent weeks.
# FINNHUB_API_KEY=
# Optional extra sources:
# SEARXNG_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8888     # after `make search`
# NEWS_API_KEY=

# --- Desk ---------------------------------------------------
BENCHMARK=SPY
REVIEW_DAYS=30
PAIRS_ALPHA=0.05
PAIRS_CORR_MIN=0.70
PAIRS_CORR_MIN_SAME_SECTOR=0.50
PAIRS_ENTRY=2.0
